  "prefLabel": "Rev 1101.02 Accounting system",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-02-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1101.02 \"Accounting system\" means the method where financial data is:\n\n(a) Captured during actual operation of the LEA;\n\n(b) Recorded in the books of account; and\n\n(c) Summarized to produce the reports required in Rev 1111.\n\nSource. #1536, eff 2-19-80; ss by #2053, eff 6-10-82; ss by #2723, eff 5-23-84, EXPIRED 5-23-90\n\nNew. #5072, eff 2-21-91, EXPIRED 2-21-97\n\nNew. #6476, eff 3-26-97; ss by #8306, eff 3-22-05; ss by #10304, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13503, eff 12-9-22",
